    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of ArcanaTris!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new way to play puzzle blocks! Choose a companion, score points, and level up! With each level, you can select power-ups to go even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer, play the classic mode and challenge yourself to break records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Modes </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Duel</strong> \u2013 Face off against another player in a score battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Coop</strong> \u2013 Play as a team and score points together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, track your stats and unlock exclusive <strong>achievements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come, the world of ArcanaTris awaits you!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of ArcanaTris!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new way to play puzzle blocks! Choose a companion, score points, and level up! With each level, you can select power-ups to go even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/cd850ef3a6b2a80751529c846422be3f.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you prefer, play the classic mode and challenge yourself to break records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/2f2f30ef3d6d49e990f89386e4be4994.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer Modes </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Duel</strong> \u2013 Face off against another player in a score battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/3525b5bef70ea7b68b189d8bbb0364fb.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>Coop</strong> \u2013 Play as a team and score points together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.poster.avif?t=1751896730\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.webm?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3580650/extras/43e8c0c625d8cf3555aca4677a103d5c.mp4?t=1751896730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, track your stats and unlock exclusive <strong>achievements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come, the world of ArcanaTris awaits you!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "ArcanaTris is a puzzle blocks game with a magical twist and roguelike mechanics. Choose a companion, rack up points, and level up. With each progression, select power-ups to evolve and take on greater challenges. Play in classic mode or challenge a friend in local co-op multiplayer!",
